msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-derivation-add.md:14
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-derivation-add.md:16
msgid ""
"This command reads from standard input a JSON representation of a [store "
"derivation](../../glossary.md#gloss-store-derivation)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-derivation-add.md:19
msgid ""
"Store derivations are used internally by Nix. They are store paths with "
"extension `.drv` that represent the build-time dependency graph to which a "
"Nix expression evaluates."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-derivation-add.md:25
msgid ""
"`nix derivation add` takes a single derivation in the JSON format. See [the "
"manual](../../protocols/json/derivation/index.md) for a documentation of "
"this format."
msgstr ""

